# sweep: --bare
# A pass-around round for three, played to the podium: renaming a player,
# the names surviving a restart, each kind of verdict, a hand-over that
# survives a restart without showing the last answer, and a shared win.
wait-for Play with friends
tap Play with friends
expect Pass-around round
tap Choose players
expect How many
tap 3
expect Cleo
# Renaming starts from the name already there.
tap Bert
expect Rename player
expect Letters and digits, twelve characters or fewer.
expect Bert
clean
shot party-rename
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
# Anything but letters and digits is left out of a name.
type zed!
tap-id kb.enter
expect zed
expect-missing Bert
expect-missing zed!
clean
shot party-players
# The player count and names are kept for the next table.
restart
wait-for Play with friends
tap Play with friends
tap Choose players
expect zed
expect Cleo
expect-missing Bert
tap Start round
expect Ada's turn
expect Science · Question 1 of 10
clean
shot party-question
# Question 1: Ada and zed are right, Cleo is not.
tap-id answer-0
expect Pass to zed
expect Ada has answered.
expect-missing Mercury
tap-id show-question
expect zed's turn
tap-id answer-0
expect Pass to Cleo
# The hand-over is kept through a restart and still hides the question.
restart
wait-for Pass to Cleo
expect-missing Mercury
expect-missing Which planet
clean
shot party-pass-restarted
tap-id show-question
expect Cleo's turn
tap-id answer-1
expect Ada and zed got it
expect Right answer · Ada and zed
expect Cleo
expect Scores
clean
shot party-reveal-some
tap Next question
expect Question 2 of 10
# Question 2: everyone is wrong.
tap-id answer-0
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-0
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-0
expect Nobody got it
tap Next question
# Question 3: everyone is right.
tap-id answer-0
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-0
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-0
expect Everyone got it
clean
shot party-reveal-everyone
tap Next question
# Question 4: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 4 of 10
tap-id answer-1
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-1
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-2
expect Ada and zed got it
tap Next question
# Question 5: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 5 of 10
tap-id answer-2
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-2
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-3
expect Ada and zed got it
tap Next question
# Question 6: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 6 of 10
tap-id answer-2
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-2
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-3
expect Ada and zed got it
tap Next question
# Question 7: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 7 of 10
tap-id answer-1
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-1
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-2
expect Ada and zed got it
tap Next question
# Question 8: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 8 of 10
tap-id answer-0
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-0
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-1
expect Ada and zed got it
tap Next question
# Question 9: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 9 of 10
tap-id answer-2
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-2
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-3
expect Ada and zed got it
tap Next question
# Question 10: Ada and zed right, Cleo wrong.
expect Question 10 of 10
tap-id answer-1
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-1
tap-id show-question
tap-id answer-2
expect Ada and zed got it
tap See results
# A tie at the top is a shared win, with tied players in the same place.
expect Results
expect Ada and zed share the win
expect 9 points
expect 1 point
clean
shot party-podium
tap Done
expect Ready when you are
expect 1 round played
restart
wait-for 1 round played
expect-missing Results
